# The card's ruling (CR 302.6): a land that becomes a creature can attack, and its {T} ability can be activated, only if
# its controller has controlled it continuously since their most recent turn began. Soulstone Sanctuary is played on
# turn 1 and animated at once by four Mox Rubies, so it may not attack, and its {T}: Add {C} may not be activated. A
# fifth Mox Ruby casts Fervent Champion, a hasty attacker, so that Bot1 is asked to declare attackers on turn 1 and
# the refusal is judged there. (The control: animated on turn 3 after being played on turn 1, the Sanctuary attacks, in
# soulstone-sanctuary-becomes-a-three-three-of-every-creature-type-for-good.)

